B.bdZ=s(["Komutlar projenin repo adresiyle haz\u0131rd\u0131r; kutunun sa\u011f\u0131ndaki simgeyle kopyala, terminale yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.","git clone ile kopyalar, cd ile klas\xf6re girer, flutter pub get ile paketleri kurars\u0131n.",'Her g\xfcn ba\u015flarken "git pull origin main" ile g\xfcncel kodu al; Hakk\u0131nda \u2192 Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7\'taki \u015fema ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n tamam\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6sterir.'],t.s)
